    voiceBellona: 'Bellona (Voice name: 燕铮莺 | Description: powerful voice, crisp enunciation, vivid delivery that gets your blood pumping; evokes clashing blades and warhorses, every syllable ringing with the spirit of the jianghu (female) | Supported languages: Mandarin Chinese, English, French, German, Russian, Italian, Spanish, Portuguese, Japanese, Korean)',
