    voiceNini: 'Nini (Voice name: 邻家妹妹 | Description: a voice soft and sticky as mochi; those drawn-out "gege" calls sweet enough to melt your bones (female) | Supported languages: Mandarin Chinese, English, French, German, Russian, Italian, Spanish, Portuguese, Japanese, Korean)',
    voiceEbona: 'Ebona (Voice name: 诡婆婆 | Description: her whisper is like a rusty key, slowly turning in the darkest corner of your mind — where your unspoken childhood shadows and nameless fears hide (female) | Supported languages: Mandarin Chinese, English, French, German, Russian, Italian, Spanish, Portuguese, Japanese, Korean)',
