    voiceStella: 'Stella (Voice name: 少女阿月 | Description: usually a sugary, dazed girl voice, but the instant she cries "in the name of the moon, I\'ll punish you," it\'s filled with unmistakable love and justice (female) | Supported languages: Mandarin Chinese, English, French, German, Russian, Italian, Spanish, Portuguese, Japanese, Korean)',
